  "name": "Empath",
  "type": "class",
  "img": "icons/magic/control/hypnosis-mesmerism-eye.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>An unarmored empath builds emotional links and spends their depth to influence creatures.</p><p>d6 Hit Die. Primary class: Wisdom and Charisma saves, Disguise Kit, and two skills from Animal Handling, Deception, Insight, Intimidation, Perception, Performance, Persuasion. No armor or weapon proficiencies.</p><p>Equipment: choose quarterstaff, improvised sling with 20 rocks, or kitchen knife; choose diplomat’s, entertainer’s, or explorer’s pack; gain a disguise kit. Equipment is selected manually.</p><p>Use native class advancement for hit points, ASIs, and Icon choice. Level-one HP uses the standard maximum Hit Die (6 + Constitution), correcting the source’s ambiguous d6 notation. Multiclass prerequisites and additional proficiencies are left to the GM.</p><table><tr><th>Level</th><th>Aura</th><th>Features</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>30 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.6d7c0eb420852d2e]{Aura}, @UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.b1b1bdb480c61d07]{Link}, @UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.a3ce0b6106cdb398]{The Right Place at the Right Time}, @UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.ee0e4f309c9a4731]{Mood Manipulation}, @UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.f87fc5cd9bc5cd06]{Apathy}, @UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.9f4bd42786b21b13]{Fervor}</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>30 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.ded32129b05bfc16]{Link Depth}, @UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.5c78c8e7160e76ba]{Pain Resonance}, @UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.c38e8334242ffdf0]{Inspirational Mantle}</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>30 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.c2d4b446a44ce54f]{Iconic Nature}</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>35 ft.</td><td>Ability Score Increase</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>35 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.22fefa8cf4bda918]{Insidious Influence}</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>35 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.e7444343ba0a70a2]{Imprint Affect}</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>40 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.7d21b3384028efa0]{Lingering Link}</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>40 ft.</td><td>Ability Score Increase</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>40 ft.</td><td>Icon feature</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>45 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.c8dee78f8c7b466c]{Extra Link}</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>45 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.e88853216dc0a71e]{Improved Empathy}</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>45 ft.</td><td>Ability Score Increase</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>50 ft.</td><td>Icon feature</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>50 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.3cb968a982080be1]{Heart to Heart}</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>50 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.56681010b753e1ab]{Cloud Mind}</td></tr><tr><td>16</td><td>55 ft.</td><td>Ability Score Increase</td></tr><tr><td>17</td><td>55 ft.</td><td>Icon feature</td></tr><tr><td>18</td><td>55 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.ad12f62c45fc1344]{Trauma Dump}</td></tr><tr><td>19</td><td>60 ft.</td><td>Ability Score Increase</td></tr><tr><td>20</td><td>60 ft.</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.empath-class.features.Item.486ea46224d1bb4f]{Share Your World}</td></tr></table><p><a href=\"https://dnd-wiki.org/wiki/Empath_(5e_Class)\">Source and complete flavor text</a></p>",
